    "original_requirement": "构建一个双传感器安防系统，使用光敏电阻 A0、HC-SR04（Trig=D8，Echo=D9）、蜂鸣器 D6 和 LED D13。只有在环境较暗且检测到 20cm 内物体时才触发安防报警；报警时 LED 闪烁、蜂鸣器间歇鸣叫，并通过串口输出 alarm。",
    "effective_requirement": "构建一个双传感器安防系统，使用光敏电阻 A0、HC-SR04（Trig=D8，Echo=D9）、蜂鸣器 D6 和 LED D13。只有在环境较暗且检测到 20cm 内物体时才触发安防报警；报警时 LED 闪烁、蜂鸣器间歇鸣叫，并通过串口输出 alarm。\nResolved hardware configuration (authoritative pin assignments; original conflicts were explicitly remapped). This is a PARTIAL inventory of recognized roles, not a whitelist: all other explicit source wiring remains required. device_role identifies wiring only, not the final catalog operation: preserve requested PWM, calibration, thresholds, timers and all other behavior.\n{\"version\": \"configuration-defaults-v3\", \"board\": \"arduino:avr:uno\", \"devices\": [{\"device_role\": \"analog_input\", \"pin\": \"A0\"}, {\"device_role\": \"digital_output\", \"pin\": \"D13\"}, {\"device_role\": \"tone_output\", \"pin\": \"D6\"}, {\"device_role\": \"ultrasonic\", \"trigger_pin\": \"D8\", \"echo_pin\": \"D9\"}], \"serial\": {\"baud\": 9600, \"framing\": \"line_or_idle\", \"idle_timeout_ms\": 20}}\nSerial baud=9600; framing=line_or_idle; idle_timeout_ms=20.",
